OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fmostly dry through the evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, though the odd shower is
OL,8,Fpossible in the west. Variable cloud
OL,9,Fwith clear spells, especially in east,
OL,10,Fleading to a chilly night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,13,Fthe day and staying mostly dry with
OL,14,Fjust the odd shower possible, these
OL,15,Fmost likely in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
